    "body": "Before:\r\n```\r\n(998) $ bash                                                                                      [discover34:~ 7:16pm]\r\nstarship: /lib64/libc.so.6: version `GLIBC_2.15' not found (required by starship)\r\nstarship: /lib64/libc.so.6: version `GLIBC_2.14' not found (required by starship)\r\n-- discover34:~ --\r\n[(941) 07:16 PM] $\r\n```\r\nUsing MUSL:\r\n```\r\n(1013) $ bash                                                                                     [discover34:~ 7:18pm]\r\n\r\nmathomp4 on discover34 in /gpfsm/dhome/mathomp4 via 🐍 v2.6.9\r\n❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe have starship, cap'n!\r\n\r\nThanks, @chipbuster ",
